  "id": "stamp-notes-canvas",
  "title": "Rubber Stamp Travel Field Notes — wide canvas",
  "summary": "Two ways to cut one artboard. Version A is a pure eight-slice strip; version B is a tighter six-slice board that hands off to an ordinary cta-scribble slide, so the format mixes with the rest of the studio. Stills are generated stand-ins — see public/carousels/stamp-notes/README.md.",
